{
  "contract": "native-schema-slices.md revision 8",
  "slice": "2f",
  "setup": {
    "notes": [
      "Main run (UID 1000). user_data values 0x2f000000000000NN identify each case",
      "uring_read_iowq reads 32 bytes from a pipe with IOSQE_ASYNC, forcing an io-wq worker",
      "aio_direct_readv_reaped reads two 4096-byte blocks with O_DIRECT through one IOCB_CMD_PREADV whose iovec lists the second buffer first; the probe clears its iovec array after io_submit, and the reap reads the buffers the kernel imported",
      "aio_direct_read_reaped reads one 4096-byte block with O_DIRECT through io_submit; its interrupt completion is observed when io_getevents reaps it",
      "sqpoll_write submits a 16-byte pipe write on an IORING_SETUP_SQPOLL ring",
      "bind binds an AF_UNIX socket to an abstract name; files_update replaces two registered file slots; waitid reaps a forked child that exited with status 0",
      "futex_wake wakes nobody on a private futex word; futex_waitv_mismatch waits on one futex whose value differs, so it completes at once with -EAGAIN",
      "provide_buffers provides 4 buffers of 128 bytes; setsockopt_cmd sets SO_RCVBUF to 65536 on a TCP socket and getsockopt_cmd reads it back",
      "timeout_canceled is a 10-second IORING_OP_TIMEOUT canceled by async_cancel (IORING_ASYNC_CANCEL by user_data); async_cancel completes with 0"
    ]
  },
